      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oak_City%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Oak City Days celebrates the town's founding every August with a parade, an ice cream social, and a large community lunch.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        27,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oak_City%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The local band The Moonlighters provides the music for a dance under the stars to end the Oak City Days festivities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oak_City%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Oak City is located in Millard County and features a cold semi-arid climate.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
