      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oak_City%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Early settlers chose Oak City because they had previously used the area to pasture their cattle during the spring and fall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
